==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].
*2 [[Gabriel]]s (500%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s (500%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s (500%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gabriel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns.
**5 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**10 [[Gabriel]]s (500%) spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to how few enemies spawn before hitting the base, it is possible and recommended to stall for money. Cats like [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]], [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone Cat]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] can help with that.

Since the Relic Doge Base curses the cats often, it is recommended to either use [[:Category:Resist Curse Cats|Curse-resistant]] or [[:Category:Cats with Curse Immunity|Curse-immune Cats]], to fight close to the Cat Base or to not fully rely on [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel Cats]]. Needless to say, a Curse-resistant [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] can provide massive help in this stage.

Using Ramen Cat as your main meatshield can be viable with research combos. [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]] along with [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria Cat]] are both extremely useful if you have them, as they are both Curse Immune and deal very high amounts of damage to Angels. The Angelic Gorys can push very hard on higher starred difficulties, so bringing additional attackers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or even [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] (preferably [[Talents|Talented]]) will help.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Theatre of Fear]] stages, Darkened House is named after a horror movie, in this case ''[[wikipedia:Black House (film)|Black House]]''.
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], the stage width was set to 4,000. The change was made because of a bug in how [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Bases]] spawn when not set as bosses.

